{"meta":{"id":"cpu-ops","category":"it/server/capacity/cpu","title":"CPU 용량 계산 (OPS)","subtitle":"","summary":"WEB/WAS 서버 CPU 용량 산정","tags":["cpu","ops","용량 산정","web","was"],"color":"amber","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-amber","source":"blog: calc/CalcCpuOps.jsx","updatedAt":"2025-02-21"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-amber-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-amber-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></span>CPU</span>\r\n<span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide text-stone-400 font-serif\">2025-02-21</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">CPU 용량 계산 (OPS)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> WEB/WAS 서버 CPU 용량 산정</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">산정 서버 정의</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">WEB<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>World Wide Web</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">주로 정적 콘텐츠를 처리하는 서버</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">WAS<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Web Application Server</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">동적인 웹 애플리케이션 처리 서버 (WEB Server + Web Container)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">단위 정의</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">OPS<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Operations Per Second</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초당 처리되는 연산 횟수 (사칙연산, 비교연산) [연산 / 초]</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">FLOPS<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Floating Point Operations Per Second</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초당 처리되는 부동소수점 연산 횟수 (부동소수의 사칙연산, 삼각함수) [부동소수점 연산 / 초]</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">MIPS<br><span class='font-normal text-stone-400'>Million Instructions Per Second</span></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초당 처리되는 명령어 개수 [백만 개의 명령어 / 초]</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">계산식</h2></div><div class=\"my-2 rounded-xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] text-stone-800 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">동시 사용자 = 전체 사용자 수 × 동시 사용자 비율\r\n필요 CPU [OPS] = 동시 사용자 × 사용자당 오퍼레이션 수 × 서버간 통신 부하 보정\r\n                × 피크타임 부하 보정 × 클러스터 보정 × 시스템 여유율</div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">입력 항목과 보정값</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">항목</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">값</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">전체 사용자 수</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">직접 입력 (기본 1,000)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">동시 사용자 비율</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">WAS 10% · WEB 5%</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">사용자당 오퍼레이션 (서버 작업의 복잡성)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">응용 로직 위주(상) 6 · 응용 로직 필수(중) 5 · 응용 로직 포함(하) 4 · 기본 데이터 3</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">서버간 통신 부하 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.02 ~ 1.10 (2% ~ 10%)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">피크타임 부하 보정</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">상 1.5 · 중 1.4 · 하 1.3 · 기타 1.2</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">클러스터 보정 (시스템 구성)</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">다중 서버 1.4 · 단일 서버 1.0</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-amber-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">시스템 여유율</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">1.3 (30%)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참고 자료</h2></div><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/server/capacity/cpu/assets/cpu-ops/x01.png\" alt=\"NCS 부록 참고 — WEB/WAS 서버 CPU 산정\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">NCS 부록 참고 — WEB/WAS 서버 CPU 산정</figcaption></figure><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">*참고 : LM2001020201_요구사항확인.pdf (출처 : NCS 국가직무능력표준)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/server/capacity/cpu/cpu-ops","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"server","title":"서버","path":"it/server"},{"id":"capacity","title":"서버 용량 산정","path":"it/server/capacity"},{"id":"cpu","title":"CPU","path":"it/server/capacity/cpu"}],"hasImage":false}